#API
@username={{$dotenv USERNAME}}
@password={{$dotenv PASSWORD}}
@email={{$dotenv EMAIL}}
@userId=1  #

### Getting all users
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users


### Create new users 
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

    {
        "username": "{{username}}",
        "password": "{{password}}",
        "email": "{{email}}"
    }

### Update a user by ID
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

    {
    "username": "ak472",
    "email": "voraphol-t@rmutp.ac.th"
    }

### Delete user by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/users/{{userId}}